  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00c7e4b39926d0b42b78e88af0359330, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1GenerTutor
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CardData
  CardPages:
  - It's so strange. Just yesterday Alexander was sitting here, and now I see a little
    girl.
  - I started my journey with him when we were the same age as you are now.
  - I have always been faithful to him and I will be faithful to you. My legions
    will do whatever you ask.
  - Would you like me to remind you of my father's advice on ruling an empire?
  Card_name: General Gefestion
  LeftChoice:
    text: Want
    effects: []
    addFlags:
    - 1.1
    removeFlags: []
    reactionText:
    - Your power is based on the support of four nations.
    - You will have to wisely sacrifice your treasury and military might to maintain
      control.
    - "\u0421\u043B\u0435\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u0437\u0430 \u0442\u0435\u043C,
      \u0447\u0442\u043E\u0431\u044B \u043F\u043E\u0434\u0434\u0435\u0440\u0436\u043A\u0430
      \u043D\u0435 \u0434\u043E\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0433\u0430\u043B\u0430 \u043A\u0440\u0438\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043A\u0438
      \u043D\u0438\u0437\u043A\u043E\u0439 \u0447\u0435\u0440\u0442\u044B, \u0438\u043D\u0430\u0447\u0435
      \u043D\u0430\u0447\u043D\u0443\u0442\u0441\u044F \u043D\u0430\u0440\u043E\u0434\u043D\u044B\u0435
      \u0432\u043E\u043B\u043D\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044F. "
    - If you don't suppress them, you will lose control over one of the peoples.
    - If you lose control over everyone, there will be nothing left of the empire.
    - Now, please welcome one of the representatives of the "beautiful" races of
      the empire.
    rewardItem: {fileID: 0}
    rewardNote: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2febb5719f0f7504bbc6478275590e5e, type: 2}
    rewardAmount: 1
